5654,"trigger_state
-----------
Normal - Trigger has fire times, and will do so on schedule
Paused - Trigger is paused and will not execute.
Complete - The trigger has completed and will not fire again.
Error - The trigger had an error, it will not be fired again.
Blocked - This trigger is associated with a job that does not allow concurrent execution, and so must wait, but the trigger would like to fire
None - The trigger doesn't exist.
Waiting - Db only status, means the job is ready to be picked up.",0
